    contentVersion: 23
    keyItems:
    - id: glow_lantern
      name: Firefly Lantern
      emoji: "\U0001F3EE"
      description: A jar of sleepy fireflies. Bright enough to light the Cavern's dark.
    - id: bog_boots
      name: Bog-Walker Boots
      emoji: "\U0001F97E"
      description: Waxed boots that never sink. The only way across Chili Ridge's red mud.
    - id: watch_key
      name: Watchtower Key
      emoji: "\U0001F5DD\uFE0F"
      description: A heavy iron key from the Wardens' old post. It fits the Ember Gate.
    - id: climbing_rope
      name: Thornsilk Rope
      emoji: "\U0001FAA2"
      description: Woven from canopy silk by the Thornwood Rangers. Strong enough for Frostfang's cliffs.
    - id: everflame_recipe
      name: Everflame Recipe
      emoji: "\U0001F4DC"
      description: Grandmother Hob's stew, hot enough to relight the Everflame itself.
    bagTiers:
    - tier: 0
      name: Belt Pouch
      price: 0
      value: 6
    - tier: 1
      name: Satchel
      price: 40
      value: 9
    - tier: 2
      name: Forager's Basket
      price: 90
      value: 12
    - tier: 3
      name: Rucksack
      price: 160
      value: 16
    - tier: 4
      name: Backpack
      price: 260
      value: 20
    - tier: 5
      name: Expedition Pack
      price: 400
      value: 25
    - tier: 6
      name: Hollow-Walker's Pack
      price: 600
      value: 30
    storyTitle: The Everflame
    storyPrologue: 'Every hearth in the valley was lit from the Everflame, a fire that has burned in the Hollow Heart for a thousand winters. This autumn it guttered. The fog crept in, the hearths went cold, and the old roads closed. Old Wren, keeper of the camp, has one map left: the Ember Path. Cook well, travel light, and bring the flame home.'
